This is code written by Hobart for testing Bluenica sensor devices.

What this code does:
1) Opens the HTi bluetooth adapter and listen passively for BLE advert messages.
2) Filters for Bluenica sensor messages and queues them for processing.
3) Every 5m will upload sensor data to the Bluenica servers.

This code could be easily adapted to listen for Hobart hands free login tags also.

This code will eventually need to be merged into chobart_d.
